    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast, shoot, slash, and burn your way though a procedurally-generated, sci-fi roguelike world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash destruction on your enemies with powerful weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, treasures and mysteries... and blast them to pieces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the flow of exploration and explosive action. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox controller and mouse/keyboard input support. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports wide-screen monitor resolutions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs great on Steamdeck. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo indie developer.</p></li></ul>",
